{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年51歲的「日本旅遊達人」杜如風（Helen），近年其身形變化成為網民熱話，繼早前成功擺脫類固醇帶來的水腫後，她近日再次於社交平台分享對鏡自拍照，整個人激瘦成「紙片人」，身形比上個月明顯再縮水，引來大批網民對其健康狀況表示擔憂。</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T09:22:08.297126+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T09:01:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T09:18:12.281634+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T09:18:12.281634+00:00","content_hash":"613851c06eaa4b1d9b99e55e85a7a50c916d8468bcc447685e8728f3c051ae54","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}